#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:2
msgid "Troubleshooting build errors"
msgstr "排查构建错误"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/contribute-to-troubleshooting.rst:3
msgid ""
"Please help us keep this section updated and contribute your own error "
"resolutions, performance improvements, etc. Send in your helpful comments or"
" ideas 💡 to support@readthedocs.org or contribute directly by clicking "
":guilabel:`Edit on GitHub` in the top right corner of this page."
msgstr ""
"请帮助我们保持本节内容更新，贡献你自己的错误解决方案、性能改进等。将你的宝贵建议或想法 💡 发送至 "
"support@readthedocs.org，或直接点击本页右上角的 :guilabel:`Edit on GitHub` 提交贡献。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:6
msgid ""
"This guide provides some common errors and resolutions encountered in the "
":doc:`build process </builds>`."
msgstr "本指南提供 :doc:`构建过程 </builds>` 中遇到的若干常见错误及解决方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:9
msgid "Git errors"
msgstr "Git 错误"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:11
msgid ""
"In the examples below, we use ``github.com``, however error messages are "
"similar for GitLab, Bitbucket etc."
msgstr "以下示例使用 ``github.com`` ，不过 GitLab、Bitbucket 等的错误信息与之类似。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:15
msgid "terminal prompts disabled"
msgstr "terminal prompts disabled"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Resolution:** This error can be quite misleading. It usually occurs when a"
" repository could not be found because of a typo in the repository name or "
"because the repository has been deleted. Verify the :guilabel:`Repository "
"URL` in your project's :menuselection:`Settings`."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 此错误可能相当误导。它通常发生在因仓库名拼写错误或仓库已被删除而找不到仓库时。请核对项目 "
":menuselection:`Settings` 中的 :guilabel:`Repository URL` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:23
msgid ""
"This error also occurs if you have changed a ``public`` repository to "
"``private`` and you are using ``https://`` in your git repository URL."
msgstr "若你把 ``public`` 仓库改为 ``private`` ，同时 Git 仓库 URL 仍使用 ``https://`` ，也会出现此错误。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:27
msgid ""
"To use private repositories, you need a plan on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com>`__."
msgstr "要使用私有仓库，需要 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com>`__ 的套餐。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:31
msgid "error: pathspec"
msgstr "error: pathspec"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Resolution:** A specified branch does not exist in the git repository. "
"This might be because the git repository was recently created (and has no "
"commits nor branches) or because the default branch has changed name. If for"
" instance, the default branch on GitHub changed from ``master`` to ``main``,"
" you need to update the :guilabel:`Default branch` in your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings`. This is the branch that Read the Docs expects to "
"find when cloning the repository."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 指定的分支在 Git 仓库中不存在。这可能是因为 Git 仓库刚创建（尚无提交和分支），或默认分支改了名字。例如，若 GitHub "
"上的默认分支从 ``master`` 改为 ``main`` ，你需要更新项目 :menuselection:`Settings` 中的 "
":guilabel:`Default branch` 。这是 Read the Docs 克隆仓库时预期找到的分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:42
msgid "Permission denied (publickey)"
msgstr "Permission denied (publickey)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Resolution:** The git repository URL points to a repository, user account "
"or organization that Read the Docs does not have credentials for. Verify "
"that the public SSH key from your Read the Docs project is installed as a "
"*deploy key* on your VCS (GitHub/GitLab/Bitbucket etc):"
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** Git 仓库 URL 指向的仓库、用户账户或组织，Read the Docs 没有相应凭据。请确认 Read the Docs "
"项目的公钥已作为*部署密钥* 安装在你的 VCS（GitHub/GitLab/Bitbucket 等）上："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:54
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:73
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> SSH keys`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> SSH keys` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:55
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:74
msgid ""
"Click on the fingerprint of the SSH key and copy the contents of the "
":guilabel:`Public SSH key` field."
msgstr "点击 SSH 密钥的指纹，复制 :guilabel:`Public SSH key` 字段的内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:56
msgid ""
"Ensure that the key exists as a deploy key at your Git provider. Here are "
"direct links to access settings for verifying and changing deploy keys - "
"customize the URLs for your Git provider and repository details:"
msgstr "确认该密钥在你的 Git 服务商上作为部署密钥存在。以下是访问设置以验证和修改部署密钥的直接链接——请按你的 Git 服务商和仓库信息调整 URL："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:58
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:77
msgid "``https://github.com/<username>/<repo>/settings/keys``"
msgstr "``https://github.com/<username>/<repo>/settings/keys``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:59
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:78
msgid "``https://gitlab.com/<username>/<repo>/-/settings/repository``"
msgstr "``https://gitlab.com/<username>/<repo>/-/settings/repository``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:60
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:79
msgid "``https://bitbucket.org/<username>/<repo>/admin/access-keys/``"
msgstr "``https://bitbucket.org/<username>/<repo>/admin/access-keys/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:64
msgid "ERROR: Repository not found."
msgstr "ERROR: Repository not found."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Resolution:** This error usually occurs on private git repositories that "
"no longer have the public SSH key from their Read the Docs project installed"
" as a *deploy key*."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 此错误通常发生在私有 Git 仓库上——其 Read the Docs 项目的公钥已不再作为*部署密钥* 安装。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:75
msgid ""
"Ensure that the key exists as a deploy key at your Git provider. Here are "
"direct links to access settings for verifying and changing deploy keys - "
"customize the URLs for your VCS host and repository details:"
msgstr "确认该密钥在你的 Git 服务商上作为部署密钥存在。以下是访问设置以验证和修改部署密钥的直接链接——请按你的 VCS 主机和仓库信息调整 URL："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:81
msgid ""
"This error is rare for public repositories. If your repository is public and"
" you see this error, it may be because you have specified a wrong domain or "
"forgotten a component in the path."
msgstr "公开仓库很少出现此错误。若你的仓库是公开的却看到此错误，可能是你指定了错误的域名或遗漏了路径中的某一段。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:85
msgid "Build timeouts and out-of-memory errors"
msgstr "构建超时和内存不足错误"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:87
msgid ""
"If your build is cancelled with a message like ``Build exited due to time "
"out`` or ``Build exited due to excessive memory consumption``, your project "
"is exceeding the :ref:`build resource limits <builds:Build resources>`."
msgstr ""
"若构建因 ``Build exited due to time out`` 或 ``Build exited due to excessive "
"memory consumption`` 之类的消息被取消，说明你的项目超出了 :ref:`构建资源限制 <builds:Build "
"resources>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:91
msgid ""
"The following steps can help you stay within limits, in order of least to "
"most disruptive:"
msgstr "以下步骤按影响从小到大排列，可帮助你控制在限制内："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Reduce the output formats you build.** Building ``htmlzip`` or ``pdf`` in "
"addition to ``html`` uses significantly more memory and time. You can "
"disable these in your :doc:`configuration file </config-file/v2>` using the "
":ref:`formats <config-file/v2:formats>` setting."
msgstr ""
"**减少构建的输出格式。** 除 ``html`` 外还构建 ``htmlzip`` 或 ``pdf`` 会显著增加内存和时间占用。可在 "
":doc:`配置文件 </config-file/v2>` 中用 :ref:`formats <config-file/v2:formats>` "
"设置禁用它们。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Trim your documentation dependencies.** If you reuse your project's main "
"``requirements.txt`` for docs, create a separate, smaller requirements file "
"that only installs what Sphinx or MkDocs actually needs. See :doc:`/guides"
"/reproducible-builds` for guidance."
msgstr ""
"**精简文档构建依赖。** 若你复用项目主 ``requirements.txt`` 构建文档，可另建一个更小的 requirements 文件，只安装"
" Sphinx 或 MkDocs 实际需要的内容。详见 :doc:`/guides/reproducible-builds` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Switch from autodoc to autoapi.** If you are using ``sphinx.ext.autodoc`` "
"and installing your entire package to generate API docs, consider `sphinx-"
"autoapi`_ instead. It generates the same API documentation output by "
"statically analysing your source code, without needing to install or import "
"your package. This can dramatically reduce both memory usage and build time."
msgstr ""
"**从 autodoc 切换到 autoapi。** 若你使用 ``sphinx.ext.autodoc`` 并安装整个包来生成 API 文档，可改用 "
"`sphinx-autoapi`_ 。它通过静态分析源代码生成相同的 API 文档输出，无需安装或导入你的包，能大幅减少内存占用和构建时间。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Use mamba instead of conda.** If your build uses conda, switching to "
":ref:`mamba <guides/conda:Making builds faster with mamba>` reduces memory "
"usage and is faster at solving environments."
msgstr ""
"**用 mamba 替代 conda。** 若你的构建使用 conda，切换到 :ref:`mamba <guides/conda:Making "
"builds faster with mamba>` 可减少内存占用，且环境求解更快。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Request a limit increase.** If none of the above steps help, you can email"
" support@readthedocs.org with your project URL and an explanation of why you"
" need more resources. On |com_brand|, contact support@readthedocs.com."
msgstr ""
"**申请提高限制。** 若上述步骤均无效，可发送邮件至 support@readthedocs.org，附上你的项目 URL "
"并说明需要更多资源的原因。在 |com_brand| 上请联系 support@readthedocs.com。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:123
msgid "Configuration file errors"
msgstr "配置文件错误"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:125
msgid ""
"If your build fails with an error message that mentions "
"``.readthedocs.yaml``, the most common causes are:"
msgstr "若构建失败并提示 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` ，最常见原因有："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:128
msgid "**Invalid or unsupported setting**"
msgstr "**设置无效或不受支持**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:129
msgid ""
"Read the Docs validates every configuration file and will fail the build if "
"it encounters an unsupported key or an invalid value. Check the "
":doc:`configuration file reference </config-file/v2>` to verify that all of "
"your settings are correct and supported."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 会验证每个配置文件，遇到不支持的键或无效值时构建会失败。请查阅 :doc:`配置文件参考 </config-"
"file/v2>` ，确认所有设置正确且受支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:134
msgid "**Missing configuration file**"
msgstr "**缺少配置文件**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:135
msgid ""
"If you have enabled the requirement for a configuration file in your project"
" settings but the file does not exist in the repository (or is in the wrong "
"location), the build will fail. The file must be named ``.readthedocs.yaml``"
" and placed at the root of your repository by default."
msgstr ""
"若你在项目设置中启用了必须提供配置文件的要求，但仓库中不存在该文件（或位置错误），构建会失败。该文件必须命名为 "
"``.readthedocs.yaml`` ，默认放在仓库根目录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:141
msgid "**More than one configuration file found**"
msgstr "**发现多个配置文件**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:142
msgid ""
"Only one ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file is expected per repository (unless you "
"are using a monorepo with a custom configuration path). If multiple "
"configuration files are detected in unexpected locations, remove the extras."
msgstr ""
"每个仓库预期只有一个 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件（除非你使用带自定义配置路径的 "
"monorepo）。若在非预期位置检测到多个配置文件，请移除多余的。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:147
msgid ""
"For a complete description of all available settings and their accepted "
"values, see the :doc:`configuration file reference </config-file/v2>`."
msgstr "所有可用设置及其可接受取值的完整说明见 :doc:`配置文件参考 </config-file/v2>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:152
msgid "General build failures"
msgstr "一般构建失败"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:154
msgid ""
"If your build fails without a clear error message related to your content or"
" configuration, it may be caused by a transient infrastructure issue on the "
"Read the Docs side."
msgstr "若构建失败但没有与内容或配置相关的明确错误信息，可能是 Read the Docs 侧的临时基础设施问题所致。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:158
msgid "**What to do:**"
msgstr "**如何处理：**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:160
msgid ""
"Check the `Read the Docs status page`_ to see if there is an ongoing "
"incident."
msgstr "查看 `Read the Docs status page`_ ，确认是否有正在处理的事件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:161
msgid ""
"Try triggering a new build by clicking :guilabel:`Build version` from your "
"project dashboard. Many transient failures resolve on a retry."
msgstr "尝试从项目仪表盘点击 :guilabel:`Build version` 触发新构建。许多临时性故障重试后即可恢复。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:163
msgid ""
"If the problem persists, send an email to support@readthedocs.org (or "
"support@readthedocs.com for |com_brand|) and include:"
msgstr ""
"若问题持续，请发送邮件至 support@readthedocs.org（|com_brand| 为 "
"support@readthedocs.com），并附上："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:166
msgid "The **project slug** (the name in the URL of your project dashboard)."
msgstr "**项目 slug** （即项目仪表盘 URL 中的名称）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:167
msgid ""
"The **build ID** from the failing build's URL (for example, in "
"``https://app.readthedocs.org/projects/myproject/builds/12345678/`` the "
"build ID is ``12345678``)."
msgstr ""
"失败构建 URL 中的**构建 ID** （例如在 "
"``https://app.readthedocs.org/projects/myproject/builds/12345678/`` 中，构建 ID "
"为 ``12345678`` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-troubleshooting.rst:171
msgid ""
"Including the build ID lets the support team look up the exact logs for your"
" build, even if the failure is not visible in the UI."
msgstr "提供构建 ID 可让支持团队查阅你构建的确切日志，即使失败在界面中不可见。"

